      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scotland%2C_Georgia"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Georgia General Assembly incorporated Scotland as a town in 1911.",
