      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scotland%2C_Georgia"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Scotland sits at 32°2′55″N 82°49′5″W, southwest of Savannah and southeast of Macon.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
